              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Banyineemu obu baraabaga nibaikara hamu, omu hali bo akafa atasigire mwana omwojo, omufaakati ataliruga omu ruganda rwa iba akaswerwa omunyaihanga; muramu we amuswere, mugenzi we nkooku akaba amuswire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omwana omwojo ow'okubanza ou balizaara, arukwe ibara lya kifa, mugenzi we, nukwo aleke kuherra kimu omu Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rus 4:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "RUT.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu mugenzi wa kifa obwaraaba atarukwenda kuswera omufaakati ogu, omufaakati agende ha irembo ly'abakuru abagambire ati: ‘Muramu wange ayangire kwikaza ibara lya mugenzi we omu Isirairi; tarukugonza kunswera.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo abakuru b'ekiikaro muramu we ekyaikaramu, bamwete babaze na uwe; kakuba ayangira kimu akagamba ati: ‘Tindukwenda kuswera omufaakati ogu’, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho omufaakati, airirre muramu we, aho omumaiso g'abakuru, amujuulemu enkaito ye, amucwere amacwanta omumaiso; agambe ati: ‘Eki nikyo kikorwege ha musaija anyakwanga kwombeka eka ya mugenzi we.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ibara ly'enju y'omusaija ogu, omu Isirairi, eraayetwaaga ‘enju yoogu ayaihirwemu enkaito.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
